# session notes and claim ledger, not build inputs. They ride in the versioned zip,
# which remains the complete build.
# CONSEQUENCE, STATED RATHER THAN DISCOVERED: okf/claims is read by main.js,
# predictions.html, ai-bridge/okfService-selfcheck.mjs and tools/ship/orphanTriage*.
# On a fresh clone of this mirror those read an empty claim set.
BACKLOG.md
TODO.md
WebGLEngine/okf/claims/
WebGLEngine/okf/log.md
Root Utils/email-draft.md
